    state verified
    statement """
        akr propose --from rejected a decision's multi-path scope: scope { path ... } is not a block, repeating path is a duplicate slot, and only scope all parsed. The keyframe-finder decision is therefore scoped all rather than the adapter/store/views/ingest/migrations/search globs.
