    state verified
    statement """
        git filter-repo to drop Damion_1-2.jpg rewrote 8 commit hashes and AKR-G011 failed on 63 observed_at pins. Remapped those SHAs through .git/filter-repo/commit-map; akr check is clean again. A rewrite that touches the root commit has to remap pins before the next akr check.
